## Setup

{% if include_mise -%}
```bash
mise install                  # the pinned tools
mise run setup:dev            # install the git hooks
mise run check                # Markdown lint + link check, as CI runs them
```
{% else -%}
```bash
uv tool install pre-commit    # if not already installed
pre-commit install            # enable git hooks
pre-commit run --all-files    # lint Markdown
```
{% endif -%}

Docs live in `docs/`; start from `docs/index.md`.

